        "html":  "\u003cdiv class=\"sticky top-0 z-modal\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"max-w-[960px] mx-auto px-6 py-12\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"mb-12 max-w-[680px]\"\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-accent-ink text-label uppercase tracking-kicker mb-3 font-medium\"\u003eГотовые решения\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch1 class=\"font-head text-h2 md:text-display tracking-tight mb-4 leading-tight\"\u003eЗакрытый каталог пакетов\u003c/h1\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-text-sub text-read leading-relaxed mb-4\"\u003eСамодостаточные пакеты, которые ты разворачиваешь в своём проекте через AI-агента (Claude Code, Cursor) за минуту. Внутри - код, документация, промпты.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ca class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-accent-ink text-body hover:text-accent-hover transition-colors\" href=\"#solutions_method\" class=\"internal-nav-link\"\u003eКак это работает →\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003csection\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"group block bg-layer-1 border border-hairline-strong rounded-nested overflow-hidden hover:border-accent/30 hover:bg-white/[0.07] transition-all\" href=\"#solutions_rules\" class=\"internal-nav-link\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"relative aspect-[16/9] w-full overflow-hidden bg-white/[0.03]\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Папка правил\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-[1.02]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 540px\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fstorage.yandexcloud.net%2Fsmyslokod-guides%2Fsolutions%2Frules%2Fhero.webp\u0026amp;w=640\u0026amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fstorage.yandexcloud.net%2Fsmyslokod-guides%2Fsolutions%2Frules%2Fhero.webp\u0026amp;w=750\u0026amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fstorage.yandexcloud.net%2Fsmyslokod-guides%2Fsolutions%2Frules%2Fhero.webp\u0026amp;w=828\u0026amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fstorage.yandexcloud.net%2Fsmyslokod-guides%2Fsolutions%2Frules%2Fhero.webp\u0026amp;w=1080\u0026amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fstorage.yandexcloud.net%2Fsmyslokod-guides%2Fsolutions%2Frules%2Fhero.webp\u0026amp;w=1200\u0026amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fstorage.yandexcloud.net%2Fsmyslokod-guides%2Fsolutions%2Frules%2Fhero.webp\u0026amp;w=1920\u0026amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fstorage.yandexcloud.net%2Fsmyslokod-guides%2Fsolutions%2Frules%2Fhero.webp\u0026amp;w=2048\u0026amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fstorage.yandexcloud.net%2Fsmyslokod-guides%2Fsolutions%2Frules%2Fhero.webp\u0026amp;w=3840\u0026amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fstorage.yandexcloud.net%2Fsmyslokod-guides%2Fsolutions%2Frules%2Fhero.webp\u0026amp;w=3840\u0026amp;q=75\"/\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"p-6\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"flex-1 min-w-0\"\u003e\u003ch3 class=\"text-lede font-bold mb-1.5 leading-snug\"\u003eПапка правил\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-text-sub text-body mb-4 leading-relaxed line-clamp-3\"\u003eГотовые регламенты для ИИ-агента: юридические нормы, стиль текстов, правила дизайна и работы с кодом. Кладёшь в проект - и агент перестаёт нарушать.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1 text-text-dim text-label\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003ev\u003c!-- --\u003e1.0.0\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"opacity-50\"\u003e·\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eобновлено \u003c!-- --\u003e27 августа 2026 г.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"opacity-50\"\u003e·\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e13 КБ\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"ml-auto text-accent-ink text-ui font-medium group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-transform\"\u003eОткрыть →\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003ca class=\"group block bg-layer-1 border border-hairline-strong rounded-nested overflow-hidden hover:border-accent/30 hover:bg-white/[0.07] transition-all\" href=\"#solutions_reels\" class=\"internal-nav-link\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"relative aspect-[16/9] w-full overflow-hidden bg-white/[0.03]\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Автопостинг рилсов\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-[1.02]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 540px\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fstorage.yandexcloud.net%2Fsmyslokod-guides%2Fsolutions%2Freels-autopost%2Fhero.webp\u0026amp;w=640\u0026amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fstorage.yandexcloud.net%2Fsmyslokod-guides%2Fsolutions%2Freels-autopost%2Fhero.webp\u0026amp;w=750\u0026amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fstorage.yandexcloud.net%2Fsmyslokod-guides%2Fsolutions%2Freels-autopost%2Fhero.webp\u0026amp;w=828\u0026amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fstorage.yandexcloud.net%2Fsmyslokod-guides%2Fsolutions%2Freels-autopost%2Fhero.webp\u0026amp;w=1080\u0026amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fstorage.yandexcloud.net%2Fsmyslokod-guides%2Fsolutions%2Freels-autopost%2Fhero.webp\u0026amp;w=1200\u0026amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fstorage.yandexcloud.net%2Fsmyslokod-guides%2Fsolutions%2Freels-autopost%2Fhero.webp\u0026amp;w=1920\u0026amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fstorage.yandexcloud.net%2Fsmyslokod-guides%2Fsolutions%2Freels-autopost%2Fhero.webp\u0026amp;w=2048\u0026amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fstorage.yandexcloud.net%2Fsmyslokod-guides%2Fsolutions%2Freels-autopost%2Fhero.webp\u0026amp;w=3840\u0026amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fstorage.yandexcloud.net%2Fsmyslokod-guides%2Fsolutions%2Freels-autopost%2Fhero.webp\u0026amp;w=3840\u0026amp;q=75\"/\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"p-6\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"flex-1 min-w-0\"\u003e\u003ch3 class=\"text-lede font-bold mb-1.5 leading-snug\"\u003eАвтопостинг рилсов\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-text-sub text-body mb-4 leading-relaxed line-clamp-3\"\u003eАгент публикует твои вертикальные видео в Instagram Reels, TikTok и YouTube Shorts одной командой: через официальные API, без риска блокировки. Мастер настройки с нуля прилагается.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1 text-text-dim text-label\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003ev\u003c!-- --\u003e1.0.0\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"opacity-50\"\u003e·\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eобновлено \u003c!-- --\u003e27 августа 2026 г.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"opacity-50\"\u003e·\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e10 КБ\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"ml-auto text-accent-ink text-ui font-medium group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-transform\"\u003eОткрыть →\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/div\u003e",
